## GOAL
Produce debuggable Android 1.6 Donut (API 4) APK for XTulator, built from the
emulator core + a new JNI/Android glue layer. Runnable on SHARP IS01
(QWERTY physical keyboard + trackball, landscape). Owner builds/tests in Docker.

## DECISIONS (user answered 2026-09-24)
- NDK: user's Docker has the toolchain (NDK r10e-era expected). Boss writes CODE.
  => Use APP_PLATFORM=android-4; write Donut-conservative NDK code (no APIs newer
  than API 4; OpenSL ES ok; pthread in libc; no `-lpthread`).
- SDK: user's Docker provides android-4 platform + aapt/dx. Boss writes Java/Ant.
- Scope: FULL Android port (JNI glue + native video/audio backends).

